CRITICAL HARDWARE & DATA LOSS DISCLAIMER (LOW-LEVEL FLASHING & FORENSICS)
================================================================================
OmniMobile Toolkit interacts directly with low-level USB interfaces, Android 
Bootloaders (Fastboot/EDL), and Apple lockdown/DFU protocols. Improper usage, 
interrupted transfers, or incompatible firmware/partition images can permanently 
brick devices or cause irreversible data loss. 

