IMPLIED. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY 
BRICKED HARDWARE, VOIDED WARRANTIES, OR DATA LOSS ARISING FROM THE USE OF THIS 
TOOLKIT.